  "details": "# a) Allow to disable prints/stickers/emojis for group type instances with checkboxes during instance creation. \n\nor\n\n# b) Make prints/stickers/emojis part of the group role permission system for even more control.\n\n---------\n\nThere are types of events where features like prints/stickers/emojis can cause disturbance or annoyance. The amount of such features is starting to make it hard to deal with in some scenarios and increases instance moderation efforts.\n\nCould be a separate option for each of them, could be just prints and stickers, it's just a collective idea for these kind of features and helping with event moderation.",
